{
  "meta": {
    "truth": "04-工程规格书.md §11 播放器状态机（含 R03 裁决，2026-10-05 冻结）",
    "note": "双端测试必须消费本文件，禁止各自另写期望值。状态机为纯函数 reduce(state, event) -> (nextState, effects)，effects 按字典序输出、无则空表。撤权事件（asset_revoked 或 selection_changed.category=revoke）一律附加 clear_textures + show_safe_image + rebuild_queue_at_safe_point；运行态（holding/transitioning/preparing）在 playable_remaining=false 时转 empty，否则保持/回到 holding；paused/suspended/resting 保持原状态且不得解除，重建在安全点进行。selection_changed 的 add/config 类只加 rebuild_queue_at_safe_point、不打断当前图、不解除暂停/休息；empty 态收到 add 直接 preparing+rebuild_queue。app_foreground 需带 queue_intact。decode_fail 需带 limit_reached（由 decode_fail_limit(queue_length)=min(5,queue_length) 判定）。",
    "states": [
      "idle",
      "preparing",
      "holding",
      "transitioning",
      "paused",
      "suspended",
      "empty",
      "resting",
      "failed"
    ],
    "effects": [
      "clear_textures",
      "show_safe_image",
      "rebuild_queue",
      "rebuild_queue_at_safe_point",
      "apply_pending_rebuild",
      "persist_snapshot",
      "save_remaining_hold",
      "complete_transition",
      "reset_hold_timer",
      "resume_until_rest_end",
      "skip_to_next"
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "PBS-01",
      "state": "idle",
      "event": {
        "type": "start"
      },
      "expected": {
        "state": "preparing",
        "effects": [
          "rebuild_queue"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
